    ],
    "source_pages": [
      2
    ],
    "text": "According to your online sales needs, our team provides some suggestions for you to solve the related problem. We propose the mathematical model to analyze the sentiment polarity and figure out the relationship between three kinds of customer feedback. We also consider how the time factor affect the rating changes and offer a simplistic model can be used to forecast rating and sentiment trend in the short term. And at last we form a COM_S parameter to define the recommended products."
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000026",
