    ],
    "source_pages": [
      2
    ],
    "text": "And when we consider the time factor, the time series model can be utilized to depict the trend of different variables. Moreover, we also focus on how the extreme sentiment which is manifested as one star or five stars changes itself or affects other rating variables. The result shows the extreme attitude would influence other customers, especially in a long period."
  },
